/media/images/dw/20261029/1192527833885315072186475.jpeg/sSpDofzhIpv-ranm3ibSdOfoaYUUC6OO13GOxddxjsU\"/><figcaption>黃大仙上邨受爆水管影響，現時全邨暫停食水供應。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"目前水務署已調派水車至啟善樓及達善樓對開協助市民。（fb/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192526027591520256581743.jpeg/292b8jKciGERT4_rZ_MZKYoyVHwXxJqpgEXAfIBFwHw\"/><figcaption>目前水務署已調派水車至啟善樓及達善樓對開協助市民。（fb/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水務署網頁指出，預計明日（29日）凌晨3時恢復供水。(水務署網站)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192532591337541632764321.jpeg/E27tEZc593ZUvUz-gwXniwYXmTVfUITLN6tXrzerV68\"/><figcaption>水務署網頁指出，預計明日（29日）凌晨3時恢復供水。(水務署網站)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:43.352796+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":990,"images":16,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:33:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:38:43.935551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:40.513568+00:00","content_hash":"d7f1b449e8fea8b2aaca67efed2669e37b7fa35d1053b5d8fd002d1942cef782","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}